# Tests are part of the public artifact — reviewers need to be able to run them.
# The whole tree is tracked, at any depth: an exception limited to `tests/*.py`
# would silently ignore `tests/unit/test_x.py` the day someone adds it.
# Generated artifacts are already excluded by the `__pycache__/` and `*.pyc`
# rules above, which apply here too.
!tests/
assets/real_charts/engisphere/*/state.json
